Scenario: View customer removal updates
	If a customer is removed from a project in OSB, the customer's tags should be removed and the customer should also be removed from the organization in Zendesk.

	Given I remove customer contacts with the following email addresses from the account "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"
	| osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	Then the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be in the organization "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer2@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be in the organization "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be a watcher on an organization with the name "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer2@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be a watcher on an organization with the name "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not have the "osb_kb" tag
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer2@lrcustomer.com.broken" should have the "osb_kb" tag
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not have the "osb_customer" tag
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer2@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not have the "osb_customer" tag
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be in the organization "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer2@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be in the organization "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer1@lrcustomer.com.broken" should not be subscribed to the organization "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"
	And the user with the email address "osb.customer2@lrcustomer.com.broken" should be subscribed to the organization "Osbzen - ${staticProjectName}"

